{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07311","headline":"送沈少府之任淮南 · 刘长卿","name":"送沈少府之任淮南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"惜君滞南楚，枳棘徒栖凤。\n独与千里帆，春风远相送。\n此行山水好，时物亦应衆。\n一鸟飞长淮，百花满云梦。\n相期丹霄路，遥听清风颂。\n勿爲州县卑，时来自爲用。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}